# Public keys the app accepts license keys from: one per line, `#` comments.
#
# Every key here stays valid for good, so a new signing key never invalidates
# the keys already sold. `npm run keygen -- init` appends; never delete a line
# while keys signed by it are in use. Each private half stays on its machine.
